  "purpose": "Shared synthetic cases for the Python and Swift estimators. Expected numbers were computed independently with `bc -l` (scale=20) as 0.0538*e(2.4208*l(DB)), then C=AGB*fraction and CO2e=C*44/12. They check arithmetic, units and domain guards only; they are not measurements of any tree.",
